  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"about.html\">Company</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">For journalists</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">For journalists</p>\n        <h1>Story material, without the paywall or the signup.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Every release we distribute is public and free to use with attribution. If you need data, an interview or a document, ask the desk directly.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"newsroom.html\">Browse the feed</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"rss.xml\">RSS</a></div>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight pt-0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  PressCosmos provides journalists with a free, searchable press release feed, an RSS subscription, filterable archives by industry and date, media asset access, and a direct editorial desk at newsroom@presscosmos.com for data requests, interviews and verification.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"grid g-2\">\n    \n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Searchable release feed</h3>\n  <p>Filter by industry, company, date or keyword. No account required, no paywall, and no scraping restrictions on the pages themselves.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"newsroom.html\">Open <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>RSS subscription</h3>\n  <p>Standard RSS 2.0 feed of every distributed release, updated continuously.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"rss.xml\">Open <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Data and access requests</h3>\n  <p>Original datasets, executive interviews and verification requests handled by a human editor.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"contact.html\">Open <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Media assets</h3>\n  <p>Logos, headshots and product imagery from releases that include them, with usage terms stated.</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"resources.html\">Open <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"callout mt-4\" data-reveal>\n    <strong>Our commitment to the desk</strong>\n    We label paid placements, we publish corrections with timestamps, we honour embargoes we set, and we do not send you a release that we know is unverifiable. If we get that wrong, email the editorial desk and a person will answer.\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Tips</p>\n      <h2>Getting the most out of our feed</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\">\n    \n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"m20 20-3.6-3.6\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Filter, do not scroll</h3>\n  <p>Industry and date filters plus keyword search cover the full archive. The feed runs to thousands of releases a year.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"m20 20-3.6-3.6\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Subscribe to a slice</h3>\n  <p>The RSS feed is the whole firehose. Contact us if you want a filtered feed for a specific beat or region.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"m20 20-3.6-3.6\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Ask for the primary source</h3>\n  <p>For any figure in a release, the desk can usually provide the underlying source document.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Need something today?</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">The editorial desk answers journalist requests within two hours during working hours.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"mailto:newsroom@presscosmos.com\">Email newsroom@presscosmos.com</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"newsroom.html\">Browse releases</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">No subscription required · Cancel anytime · Human editorial review on every release</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
